0..83 Comment "/// This source states unbiased composition of a path chain at a certified stratum."
84..87 Comment "///"
88..148 Comment "/// A chain has one composite across all of its bracketings."
149..196 Comment "/// The former therefore selects no bracketing."
197..200 Comment "///"
201..263 Comment "/// The sub-site for a chain certifies its stratum and degree."
264..331 Comment "/// Evaluation and the kernel use the left-nested `Path.step` fold."
332..335 Comment "///"
